--[[
    Fruit Spin Predictor  •  Blox Fruits UI  (v2 – Blox Fruits style)
    ------------------------------------------------------------------
    HONEST BY DESIGN: this UI never invents a fruit. The gacha-style spin
    is only an animation and ALWAYS lands on the fruit from your real
    data source. With no data, there is no spin and no fruit.

    Connect a data source in ONE of these ways:
      1) CONFIG.PredictionURL -> an endpoint that returns JSON like
         {"fruit":"Kitsune","rarity":"Mythical","icon":"rbxassetid://123"}
         ("rarity" and "icon" are optional; rarity is filled in from the table below)
      2) getgenv().FruitPrediction = { fruit = "Kitsune" }
         or a function that returns that table (called on every refresh)

    Fruit icons: put Roblox image asset ids in FRUIT_ICONS (or send "icon").
    Fruits without one get a drawn swirl "devil fruit" in their rarity colour.
    RightControl hides / shows the window.
]]

